    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "clocks",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 836,
      "width": 840,
      "height": 90,
      "text": "Three clocks: attemptedAt = first try (Slack search window, never refreshed on steal).\nclaimedAt = this worker's lease (FOR UPDATE only during the claim txn; then unlocked).\ndeliveredAt = audit. markDelivered is CAS on claimedAt. Slack fail → releaseClaim → pending.\nLease expired delivering → attempt = uncertain_retry → findPosted(review_record_id) before post.",
      "originalText": "Three clocks: attemptedAt = first try (Slack search window, never refreshed on steal).\nclaimedAt = this worker's lease (FOR UPDATE only during the claim txn; then unlocked).\ndeliveredAt = audit. markDelivered is CAS on claimedAt. Slack fail → releaseClaim → pending.\nLease expired delivering → attempt = uncertain_retry → findPosted(review_record_id) before post.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 204051,
      "version": 1,
