    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "say_t",
      "x": 1336,
      "y": 272,
      "width": 468,
      "height": 368,
      "text": "Bet: first-pass risk signal that cannot\nblock a merge. A gating bot gets disabled\nbefore it can earn trust.\n\nNever review a push. Incomplete states\nare noise. Mention to re-run.\n\nSlack noise is shared (one PR, one slot).\nGitHub duplicate is scoped to that PR.\nSame find-before-post family; I shipped\nSlack first. Marker already in the body.\n\nUntrusted PR comments: evidence only.\n\nI've been running this on my own PRs\nin this repo. Not a team yet.\n\nWeights live in markdown, not code:\nsec/corr/data 3, blast/tests 2, read 1.",
      "originalText": "Bet: first-pass risk signal that cannot\nblock a merge. A gating bot gets disabled\nbefore it can earn trust.\n\nNever review a push. Incomplete states\nare noise. Mention to re-run.\n\nSlack noise is shared (one PR, one slot).\nGitHub duplicate is scoped to that PR.\nSame find-before-post family; I shipped\nSlack first. Marker already in the body.\n\nUntrusted PR comments: evidence only.\n\nI've been running this on my own PRs\nin this repo. Not a team yet.\n\nWeights live in markdown, not code:\nsec/corr/data 3, blast/tests 2, read 1.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 205013,
