    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "notship_t",
      "x": 1336,
      "y": 732,
      "width": 468,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "sidebar re-request review\nSlack stale marker on push\nSlack re-run button\nthumbs / captured feedback\nblind eval pairs (ADR 0002)\ncoalesce (we have steer, not queue)\nmerge gating (ADR 0001 defers it)\nGitHub find-before-post\n\nNext: thumbs (dataset), then GitHub\nlookup on <!-- evee:formal-review -->.\nStale is easy UX after that.",
      "originalText": "sidebar re-request review\nSlack stale marker on push\nSlack re-run button\nthumbs / captured feedback\nblind eval pairs (ADR 0002)\ncoalesce (we have steer, not queue)\nmerge gating (ADR 0001 defers it)\nGitHub find-before-post\n\nNext: thumbs (dataset), then GitHub\nlookup on <!-- evee:formal-review -->.\nStale is easy UX after that.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
